== Syntax ==

=== Cases ===
Tuparí has four [[Grammatical case|cases]], as seen in the table below.{{sfn|Singerman|2018}}{{rp|63}} Note that Nuclear and Locative cases can be stacked.

{| class="wikitable"
|+Grammatical case {{sfn|Singerman|2018}}{{rp|63}}
!Form of Case Suffix
!Case Suffix in Nasal Contexts
!Gloss
|-
| {{lang|tpr|-et/ -t}}
| {{lang|tpr|-en/ -n}}
|NUC (nuclear)
|-
| {{lang|tpr|-pe}}
| {{lang|tpr|-pe}}
|LOC ([[Locative case|locative]])
|-
| {{lang|tpr|-m/ -o}}
| {{lang|tpr|-m/ -õ}}
|INS (instrumental-lative)
